inl compiler_generated_warning_cleanup () = Task ("COMPILER-GENERATED-WARNING-CLEANUP", "Eliminate unused generated tuple auxiliaries and ignored-result warning noise in package-only Rust residuals so rustc -D warnings passes without lint allowances. The facade now prunes tuple-field bindings only when the generated local has exactly the declaration and projection assignment and no other references. An offline rebuild against the SDK-shipped FSharp.Core passed; a wildcard-projection fixture reproduces the prior warning and is clean after the pass, while current EOIE owners remain byte-identical. Compiler cleanup is settled without product-semantic credit.", TaskKind, P1, D5, 100u32, Done, "MIGRATION-UNIT-67", "compiler,rust,generated,warnings,shrinkage,spiral-first", "next", "current")
