inl coverage_floor_recovery () = Task ("COVERAGE-FLOOR-RECOVERY", "CoverageAttainment remains checkpoint eight-hundred-four on the unchanged seventeen-thousand-three-hundred-three-line tree with durable current.lcov SHA 4c9e577c4bd1d3c799f59773337c38e47f45d2e025f9810c5b059f01fd4116b4. The cost curve shows seven-hundred-eighty-six new covered lines to eight-hundred-fifty and one-thousand-six-hundred-fifty-one to nine-hundred. Coverage remains an active quality objective, but it no longer gates retirement of fully absorbed fallback binaries.", Epic, P0, D8, 89u32, Active, "COVERAGE-COMPARABLE-REFRESH,COVERAGE-SMOKE-SHARDED-RESUME,COVERAGE-CHECKPOINT-DURABILITY,COVERAGE-COST-CURVE", "coverage,lcov,quality,owner,uncovered,shrinkage", "next", "current")
