inl post_retirement_phase_denominator () = Task ("POST-RETIREMENT-PHASE-DENOMINATOR", "Freeze the active phase denominator as sixteen weighted dimensions totaling one hundred weight points: runtime-drift burndown twelve, Agile RustGlobal boundary two, coverage quality eight, parallel readiness eight, canonical plan IR ten, physical boundary hardening eight, cold-build/toolchain five, evidence currentness five, generic workspace fit five, reflected CommandSpec four, immutable journal six, confined IO six, autopoietic agent seven, sensor-policy feedback five, causal delta store four and onboarding five. Current weighted readiness is four-hundred-seventy-nine of one thousand. ProjectSota must equal this active denominator; completed migration and legacy absorption remain historical evidence rather than inflating active readiness.", Epic, P0, D6, 100u32, Done, "COVERAGE-COST-CURVE,FALLBACK-EXCLUSIVE-AUTHORITY-DECISION", "phase,denominator,post-retirement,anti-drift,ratings,weighted", "current", "settled")
